Hi, I’m Andrew (@theandrewlamb). Father of 5 daughters, and I currently own 19 Sober Living homes in CA.

In 2021 I was working 60+ hour weeks as a realtor. I was exhausted and missing time with my family.

Then I discovered sober living homes: structured housing for people in recovery who need a safe place to rebuild their lives.

I turned my first rental from $600/month to $6,000/month by housing people who needed the most help.

Today I work about 2 hours a week, my family’s taken care of, and 150+ individuals have stable housing while they get back on their feet.

I share everything I’ve learned here... the financing, the systems, the mistakes to avoid.

Hope you’ll find value on my page:

